graph TD
    subgraph Browser
        A["Trigger: hx-trigger
        What event fires the request?
        click, change, submit, keyup, load, revealed, every 2s"]

        B["Request: hx-get / hx-post
        Which URL do we hit?
        hx-get=/provinces
        hx-post=/barangay/update"]

        E["Target: hx-target
        Which element gets updated?
        CSS selector, this, next, closest"]

        F["Swap: hx-swap
        How does new content replace old?
        innerHTML (default), outerHTML,
        beforeend, afterbegin, delete, none"]
    end

    subgraph Server
        C["Server: Express Route
        app.get or app.post handler
        Queries database, prepares data"]

        D["Response: HTML Fragment
        res.render partial template
        NO html, head, or body tags
        Just the snippet the target needs"]
    end

    A --> B
    B -->|HTTP request| C
    C --> D
    D -->|HTTP response| E
    E --> F

    style A fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f9a825
    style B fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f9a825
    style C fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#0288d1
    style D fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#0288d1
    style E fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#388e3c
    style F fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#388e3c
